    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a bid to address the mental health crisis at the grassroots level, over 50 community leaders including spiritual leaders from 10 countries across East Africa and South Asia came together for a unique, intensive Training-of-Trainers on mental health first response, held from November 1 to 6, 2024 at the Aga Khan University.",
